              "count": 1,
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "",
                  "status": "",
                  "title": "compliance: S07 is assessed clause by clause against SPEC §8 S7 and plan §7. The seven properties are: (a) three revisions with max(seq)=3 and a compare that shows the status change; (b) an idempotent seed returning {0,0,N}; (c) both GIN indexes used under enable_seqscan=off with idx_scan rising on a 50k-row load; (d) relevance where B meets §5.6's recall@5 ≥ 0.75, MRR ≥ 0.60 and B ≥ C, with pgvector shipped only when the loss exceeds 0.05 or C is unreachable and B fails A + 0.20; (e) traceability in both directions with zero cross-tenant rows; (f) quality scoring read-only with version and status untouched; (g) no orphan over RM's 28 modules. Each property is carried by a named target (search_index, s07_assets, s07_requests, s07_store, s07_seed, s07_governance, search_eval) or the EXPLAIN block. The snapshot records no Phase-G review and no run of these properties; this rework supplies the seven artefacts, this contract, the Phase-G review and the closure review, records the level consistent, and re-closes on the 15 P0 checks of acceptance/programme/S07.toml. The close gate is decided by an approver other than its requester under the standing delegation."
                }
              ],
