                  "status": "",
                  "title": "commitments: Deliver the tool platform of SPEC_V2 §12: the broker tools.call as the only path from a conveyor-internal run to a job backend; the tool, toolkit, tool_binding and tool_call tables; effect classes read, write, destructive and spend with tenant-configured approvals; binding-scoped credential aliases over sealed secrets; the direct MinIO storage adapter under tenant/<tenant_id>/; the coding toolkit and one kag-era toolkit; V1's external actions migrated; and the six gate proofs, each asserting on the wire through a counting HTTP stub."
