              "count": 1,
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "",
                  "status": "",
                  "title": "commitments: T14 commits to importing the estate's live services onto T13's tool platform — coding fleet, strata, billing and licence reads, webscraper, media_discovery, scientific_processor, lean4_prover, video-compiler, the w2v orchestrator and the ops read tools — with evidence_review, discovery :8807 and the planned AHTAPol services entering as draft, and to the four gate clauses: one probe and one live call per published toolkit, the scientific_processor scale-up and scale-back receipt, a zero-use report, and a backend-outage unbind test in which new runs unbind while in-flight runs finish. It also commits to broker-only calls, effect classes and credential profiles inherited from T13, and to a receipt per claim. As of the snapshot none of these is receipted; the contract records the commitments and the gap, and it authorises no closure."
                }
              ],
